# This repository intentionally tracks only the current manuscript,
# its reproducibility assets, and the current source code.
*

# Repository configuration
!/.gitignore

# Current manuscript and its direct assets
!/Error_Corrected_Probabilistic_Quantum_Huffman_Coding_with_Group_Ancilla_and_Posterior_Correction__1_/
/Error_Corrected_Probabilistic_Quantum_Huffman_Coding_with_Group_Ancilla_and_Posterior_Correction__1_/*
